<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested, compared with Friday's close, USDA said. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs ld 68.00.</p>
<p>Carcass basis Steers and heifers not well tested. Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 109.00. Reported sales for Mon -  100   Wk to Date - 7,300.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
